# propose_to_buy — on a trader's premises, in a real location
#
# success.cli runs in the test location, whose people trade wherever they stand. This one runs on
# the farm, where trade happens only on premises (TradeGate): the farm's premises are its Storage
# Shed, and at location id 1 under --npc-static the swineherd stands in it. The pair with
# off_premises.cli is the rule itself — the same farm, the same affinity, a trader in the store is
# offered the trade and a trader in the coop is not.
#
# The farm is used rather than a rolled location because its area names are written out in
# FarmSceneFactory, not drawn: "Storage Shed" and "Chicken Coop" stay what they are.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --npc-affinity CloseFriend --location-type farm --location-id 1 --npc-static --start-area "Storage Shed" --period noon --observe-only "swineherd"

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy succeed
goal propose_to_buy
advance 12 180

click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180

click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect SUCCESS
expect Conversation:
expect-verb propose_to_buy
expect-outcome dialogue_trigger
quit
